{"page":61,"verses":[{"verse_key":"3:84","surah":3,"ayah":84,"ar_uthmani":"قُلْ ءَامَنَّا بِٱللَّهِ وَمَآ أُنزِلَ عَلَيْنَا وَمَآ أُنزِلَ عَلَىٰٓ إِبْرَٰهِيمَ وَإِسْمَـٰعِيلَ وَإِسْحَـٰقَ وَيَعْقُوبَ وَٱلْأَسْبَاطِ وَمَآ أُوتِىَ مُوسَىٰ وَعِيسَىٰ وَٱلنَّبِيُّونَ مِن رَّبِّهِمْ لَا نُفَرِّقُ بَيْنَ أَحَدٍ مِّنْهُمْ وَنَحْنُ لَهُۥ مُسْلِمُونَ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"Say [Muhammad], ‘We [Muslims] believe in God and in what has been sent down to us and to Abraham, Ishmael, Isaac, Jacob, and the Tribes. We believe in what has been given to Moses, Jesus, and the prophets from their Lord. We do not make a distinction between any of the [prophets]. It is to Him that we devote ourselves.’","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"قُلْ","en_gloss":"Say","transliteration":"qul","verse_key":"3:84"},{"pos":2,"ar":"ءَامَنَّا","en_gloss":"We believed","transliteration":"āmannā","verse_key":"3:84"},{"pos":3,"ar":"بِٱللَّهِ","en_gloss":"in Allah","transliteration":"bil-lahi","verse_key":"3:84"},{"pos":4,"ar":"وَمَآ","en_gloss":"and what","transliteration":"wamā","verse_key":"3:84"},{"pos":5,"ar":"أُنزِلَ","en_gloss":"(is) revealed","transliteration":"unzila","verse_key":"3:84"},{"pos":6,"ar":"عَلَيْنَا","en_gloss":"on us","transliteration":"ʿalaynā","verse_key":"3:84"},{"pos":7,"ar":"وَمَآ","en_gloss":"and what","transliteration":"wamā","verse_key":"3:84"},{"pos":8,"ar":"أُنزِلَ","en_gloss":"was revealed","transliteration":"unzila","verse_key":"3:84"},{"pos":9,"ar":"عَلَىٰٓ","en_gloss":"on","transliteration":"ʿalā","verse_key":"3:84"},{"pos":10,"ar":"إِبْرَٰهِيمَ","en_gloss":"Ibrahim","transliteration":"ib'rāhīma","verse_key":"3:84"},{"pos":11,"ar":"وَإِسْمَـٰعِيلَ","en_gloss":"and Ishmael","transliteration":"wa-is'māʿīla","verse_key":"3:84"},{"pos":12,"ar":"وَإِسْحَـٰقَ","en_gloss":"and Isaac","transliteration":"wa-is'ḥāqa","verse_key":"3:84"},{"pos":13,"ar":"وَيَعْقُوبَ","en_gloss":"and Yaqub","transliteration":"wayaʿqūba","verse_key":"3:84"},{"pos":14,"ar":"وَٱلْأَسْبَاطِ","en_gloss":"