(88)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"3:88"}]},{"verse_key":"3:89","surah":3,"ayah":89,"ar_uthmani":"إِلَّا ٱلَّذِينَ تَابُوا۟ مِنۢ بَعْدِ ذَٰلِكَ وَأَصْلَحُوا۟ فَإِنَّ ٱللَّهَ غَفُورٌ رَّحِيمٌ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"Not so those who afterwards repent and mend their ways- God is most forgiving and merciful-","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"إِلَّا","en_gloss":"Except","transliteration":"illā","verse_key":"3:89"},{"pos":2,"ar":"ٱلَّذِينَ","en_gloss":"those who","transliteration":"alladhīna","verse_key":"3:89"},{"pos":3,"ar":"تَابُوا۟","en_gloss":"repent","transliteration":"tābū","verse_key":"3:89"},{"pos":4,"ar":"مِنۢ","en_gloss":"from","transliteration":"min","verse_key":"3:89"},{"pos":5,"ar":"بَعْدِ","en_gloss":"after","transliteration":"baʿdi","verse_key":"3:89"},{"pos":6,"ar":"ذَٰلِكَ","en_gloss":"that","transliteration":"dhālika","verse_key":"3:89"},{"pos":7,"ar":"وَأَصْلَحُوا۟","en_gloss":"and reform[ed] themselves","transliteration":"wa-aṣlaḥū","verse_key":"3:89"},{"pos":8,"ar":"فَإِنَّ","en_gloss":"Then indeed","transliteration":"fa-inna","verse_key":"3:89"},{"pos":9,"ar":"ٱللَّهَ","en_gloss":"Allah","transliteration":"l-laha","verse_key":"3:89"},{"pos":10,"ar":"غَفُورٌۭ","en_gloss":"(is) Oft-Forgiving","transliteration":"ghafūrun","verse_key":"3:89"},{"pos":11,"ar":"رَّحِيمٌ","en_gloss":"Most Merciful","transliteration":"raḥīmun","verse_key":"3:89"},{"pos":12,"ar":"٨٩","en_gloss":"(89)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"3:89"}]},{"verse_key":"3:90","surah":3,"ayah":90,"ar_uthmani":"إِنَّ ٱلَّذِينَ كَفَرُوا۟ بَعْدَ إِيمَـٰنِهِمْ ثُمَّ ٱزْدَادُوا۟ كُفْرًا لَّن تُقْبَلَ تَوْبَتُهُمْ وَأُو۟لَـٰٓئِكَ هُمُ ٱلضَّآلُّونَ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"[although] the repentance of those who, having believed, then increase in their disbelief, will not be accepted. They are the ones who have gone [far] astray:","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"إِنَّ","en_gloss":"Indeed","transliteration":"inna","verse_key":"3:90"},{"pos":2,"ar":"ٱلَّذِينَ","en_gloss":"those who","transliteratio